/*
 * KiTTY: kitty.exe's event log message table a second time, as language
 * neutral. windmc writes it as English (0x409) only, and the Event Viewer
 * of a Windows in another language then finds no entry and shows no text.
 * windmc cannot write language 0, so windres takes the same .bin again.
 */

LANGUAGE 0, 0
1 MESSAGETABLE "MSG00409.bin"
